<title>USA: CCC buys 900 tonnes of lentils for export to Iraq.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 900 tonnes of lentils for export to Iraq.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it bought 900 tonnes of dry lentils for export to Iraq.</p>
<p>It purchased 760 tonnes from Continental Grain for $491.23 per tonne and 140 tonnes from Northwest Pea &amp; Bean for $493.39, both FOB Jacintoport, Texas.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for December 6-20.</p>
<p>--Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
